{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c1f1f593-89ee-8964-8ca5-8a471f720ee4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:28:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I would like to inquire about a fence. Am I speaking with the correct department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are, yes. Tell me what you're thinking of doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would like to enclose the side yard at my home, because I have a toddler in the house and [line breaks up] she is quite quick now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out on me there. You want to enclose the side yard for a toddler, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Forgive me, the reception is poor. I am in the car. I just paused my audiobook so I could hear you properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. What kind of fence are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pressure-treated wood, six feet tall. Is that the proper term, pressure-treated? The man at the lumber yard said it was the sensible choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the right term. And six feet is on the tall side, so that matters. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "81 Pelham Street, on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Historic Hill. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So my question is this. Is there a certain height below which a fence no longer requires a permit? Or does every fence require one? I confess I do not understand how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. In general, a fence usually does need a permit, and height is one of the things we look at. Six feet would definitely need review. Being in a historic district can add another step too, so I'd want you to talk to us before you buy anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So there is no height at which it is simply exempt? I thought perhaps four feet was exempt, [inaudible] or was that for something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't count on any height being exempt without checking. Four feet may be what you heard about a different rule, like what's allowed in front. I'd rather the inspector confirm the numbers for your lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And how close to the property line may I build it? I would like to inquire whether it may be placed directly on the line, or must it be set back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That depends on your lot and where the line actually is. Some fences go right at the line, some are set in a bit. You'd want a survey or plot plan handy. The permit application asks you to show where it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A plot plan. Is that the same as a survey? I have some papers from when I purchased the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close, but not always. The papers from your closing might include a mortgage plot plan, which is often not exact. If you have a real survey, bring that. Otherwise, bring what you have and the inspector will tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. So I should come in with the papers, and not purchase the wood yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Hold off on the wood. Can I take a callback number in case we get cut off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. It is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0163. Come by the office and we'll walk you through the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I think I understand, though I may still have a question or two when I arrive. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Drive safe in this rain."
    }
  ],
